IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. KDPMAIN.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PREFIX      PIC X(10) VALUE "KDPMember:".
01 WS-MEMBER-ID   PIC X(25) VALUE "KDPMember:KL5UQ4f48673352".
01 WS-ROLE        PIC X(6)  VALUE "Member".
01 WS-POINTS      PIC 9     VALUE 1.
01 WS-CODE        PIC X(25).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
*> The short code after the KDPMember: prefix
    IF WS-MEMBER-ID(1:10) = WS-PREFIX
        MOVE WS-MEMBER-ID(11:15) TO WS-CODE
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-MEMBER-ID TO WS-CODE
    END-IF
    DISPLAY "=== KDP Forum Profile ==="
    DISPLAY "Nickname : " WS-MEMBER-ID
    DISPLAY "Code     : " WS-CODE
    DISPLAY "Role     : " WS-ROLE
    DISPLAY "Points   : " WS-POINTS
    STOP RUN.
